        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a sleeper—a half-forgotten deity seeking to regain their former power and ascend once again. Whether the cruel Igizul or the cunning Seth, each has their own tragic story, an arsenal of fearsome spells, and an insatiable thirst for new knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/3575ba565c47dec1c48f27baad8b81a9.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/3575ba565c47dec1c48f27baad8b81a9.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal on the world map is to find and capture places of power and neutral cities as quickly as possible. Maintain a delicate balance between gold, mana, and rare resources—all of them essential to your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your economy is strong, your heroes are seasoned, and you've mastered a few new spells, you can begin your conquest of the world—and perhaps even claim the legendary lost temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/27df9f8f146316bce66da7cfb7d50d89.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/27df9f8f146316bce66da7cfb7d50d89.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When armies meet, the battle moves to a separate field where you must prove your superiority in both strength and tactics. Your heroes wield dozens of spells, and the unique abilities of your creatures can turn the tide of any fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/5bb21374bd1f4db29131d112509eabab.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/5bb21374bd1f4db29131d112509eabab.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respectful Attitude</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game respects you and your time. You make few decisions, but each one carries weight. There's no tedious micromanagement and no long waits for your turn. You won't be shuffling dozens of armies around. You won't be hitting &quot;End Turn&quot; over and over, waiting for some bar to fill up. Creatures have few abilities, but each does something meaningful. The interface is simple and works the same way on the world map and in combat. Important information is explained in tooltips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/2516ba1e595a9e0fa1d23ccc43ea049f.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/2516ba1e595a9e0fa1d23ccc43ea049f.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=128 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melancholic Vibe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Luna is a land of eternal twilight, bathed in the blue light of a twin stars and shrouded in thick mist. Here, dreams and memories hold real power. It's an ancient world full of mysteries, abandoned ruins, once-famous heroes, and mystical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/ecf9cfd62d429541733cec7fc249e3e6.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/ecf9cfd62d429541733cec7fc249e3e6.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=128 /></span> </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a sleeper—a half-forgotten deity seeking to regain their former power and ascend once again. Whether the cruel Igizul or the cunning Seth, each has their own tragic story, an arsenal of fearsome spells, and an insatiable thirst for new knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/3575ba565c47dec1c48f27baad8b81a9.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/3575ba565c47dec1c48f27baad8b81a9.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal on the world map is to find and capture places of power and neutral cities as quickly as possible. Maintain a delicate balance between gold, mana, and rare resources—all of them essential to your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your economy is strong, your heroes are seasoned, and you've mastered a few new spells, you can begin your conquest of the world—and perhaps even claim the legendary lost temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/27df9f8f146316bce66da7cfb7d50d89.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/27df9f8f146316bce66da7cfb7d50d89.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When armies meet, the battle moves to a separate field where you must prove your superiority in both strength and tactics. Your heroes wield dozens of spells, and the unique abilities of your creatures can turn the tide of any fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/5bb21374bd1f4db29131d112509eabab.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/5bb21374bd1f4db29131d112509eabab.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respectful Attitude</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game respects you and your time. You make few decisions, but each one carries weight. There's no tedious micromanagement and no long waits for your turn. You won't be shuffling dozens of armies around. You won't be hitting &quot;End Turn&quot; over and over, waiting for some bar to fill up. Creatures have few abilities, but each does something meaningful. The interface is simple and works the same way on the world map and in combat. Important information is explained in tooltips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/2516ba1e595a9e0fa1d23ccc43ea049f.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/2516ba1e595a9e0fa1d23ccc43ea049f.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=128 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melancholic Vibe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Luna is a land of eternal twilight, bathed in the blue light of a twin stars and shrouded in thick mist. Here, dreams and memories hold real power. It's an ancient world full of mysteries, abandoned ruins, once-famous heroes, and mystical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras/ecf9cfd62d429541733cec7fc249e3e6.avif?t=1789034616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393510/extras_big/ecf9cfd62d429541733cec7fc249e3e6.webp?t=1789034616 width=1560 height=128 /></span> </p>",
